OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian dies after being hit by
OL,4,Acar
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 68-year-old man has died after being
OL,7,Fhit by a car, say police.
OL,9,FThe man, from Bishops Cleeve in
OL,10,FGloucestershire, was struck by a silver
OL,11,FHyundai Ionic on Lansdown Road in
OL,12,FCheltenham at about 11:00 GMT on
OL,13,FTuesday.
OL,15,FHe was taken to Southmead Hospital in
OL,16,FBristol with serious injuries, but died
OL,17,Fthere on Thursday, Gloucestershire
OL,18,FConstabulary said.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
