OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian dies after being hit by
OL,4,Acar
OL,5,
OL,6,FInsp Martyn Murawa said officers had
OL,7,Fbeen unable to contact his next of kin,
OL,8,Fadding: "We're now asking for help from
OL,9,Fthe public."
